{"seq":2,"slug":"sed","title":"sed 流编辑器","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/shell-scripting/text-processing/sed","wordCount":729,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"sed-流编辑器\">sed 流编辑器</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>sed（Stream Editor）是一种面向行的流式文本编辑器，它逐行读取输入，对每行应用编辑命令，然后将结果输出到标准输出。sed 的核心设计理念是&quot;非交互式编辑&quot;——它不需要打开文件进行手动修改，而是通过脚本化的方式批量处理文本，这使其成为 Shell 脚本中自动化文本处理的首选工具。</p>\n<p>sed 使用两个缓冲区工作：模式空间（Pattern Space）和保持空间（Hold Space）。模式空间是当前正在处理的行，保持空间是一个辅助缓冲区，可以在处理过程中暂存数据。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[输入流] --&gt; B[读取一行到模式空间]&#10;    B --&gt; C{匹配地址?}&#10;    C --&gt;|是| D[执行编辑命令]&#10;    C --&gt;|否| E[跳过命令]&#10;    D --&gt; F{有更多命令?}&#10;    E --&gt; F&#10;    F --&gt;|是| C&#10;    F --&gt;|否| G[输出模式空间]&#10;    G --&gt; H{输入结束?}&#10;    H --&gt;|否| B&#10;    H --&gt;|是| I[完成]\">graph TD\n    A[输入流] --&gt; B[读取一行到模式空间]\n    B --&gt; C{匹配地址?}\n    C --&gt;|是| D[执行编辑命令]\n    C --&gt;|否| E[跳过命令]\n    D --&gt; F{有更多命令?}\n    E --&gt; F\n    F --&gt;|是| C\n    F --&gt;|否| G[输出模式空间]\n    G --&gt; H{输入结束?}\n    H --&gt;|否| B\n    H --&gt;|是| I[完成]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>功能</th>\n<th>sed 命令</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>替换</td>\n<td><code>s/old/new/</code></td>\n<td>替换文本</td>\n<td><code>s/foo/bar/g</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>删除</td>\n<td><code>d</code></td>\n<td>删除行</td>\n<td><code>3d</code> 或 <code>/pattern/d</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>插入</td>\n<td><code>i\\text</code></td>\n<td>在行前插入</td>\n<td><code>3i\\新行内容</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>追加</td>\n<td><code>a\\text</code></td>\n<td>在行后追加</td>\n<td><code>$a\\最后一行</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>打印</td>\n<td><code>p</code></td>\n<td>打印行</td>\n<td><code>-n &#39;/pattern/p&#39;</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>替换行</td>\n<td><code>c\\text</code></td>\n<td>替换整行</td>\n<td><code>/old/c\\新内容</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>转换</td>\n<td><code>y/abc/ABC/</code></td>\n<td>字符转换</td>\n<td>类似 tr 命令</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"替换命令详解\">替换命令详解</h2><p>替换（<code>s</code>）是 sed 最常用的命令，语法为 <code>s/模式/替换/标志</code>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"echo &quot;hello world&quot; | sed &#39;s/world/Shell/&#39;&#10;&#10;sed &#39;s/http:/https:/&#39; urls.txt&#10;&#10;sed &#39;s/old/new/g&#39; file.txt&#10;&#10;sed &#39;s/error/ERROR/gi&#39; log.txt&#10;&#10;sed &#39;s|/usr/local|/opt|g&#39; paths.txt&#10;sed &#39;s#http://#https://#g&#39; urls.txt&#10;&#10;echo &quot;2025-04-11&quot; | sed &#39;s/\\([0-9]\\{4\\}\\)-\\([0-9]\\{2\\}\\)-\\([0-9]\\{2\\}\\)/\\3\\/\\2\\/\\1/&#39;&#10;&#10;echo &quot;hello world&quot; | sed -E &#39;s/(hello) (world)/\\2 \\1/&#39;&#10;&#10;echo &quot;foobar&quot; | sed &#39;s/\\(foo\\)\\(bar\\)/\\2_\\1/&#39;&#10;&#10;sed -E &#39;s/^([[:space:]]*)&quot;([^&quot;]+)&quot;:/\\1\\2:/&#39; config.json&#10;&#10;echo &quot;path/to/file.txt&quot; | sed &#39;s/.*\\///&#39;    # file.txt&#10;echo &quot;path/to/file.txt&quot; | sed &#39;s/\\.[^.]*$//&#39; # path/to/file&#10;&#10;sed &#39;s/password=.*/password=***REDACTED***/&#39; config.txt&#10;&#10;sed -E &#39;s/[0-9]{1,3}\\.[0-9]{1,3}\\.[0-9]{1,3}\\.[0-9]{1,3}/[IP_REMOVED]/g&#39; access.log\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">echo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"hello world\"</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> sed</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 's/world/Shell/'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">sed</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 's/http:/https:/'</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> urls.txt</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">sed</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 's/old/new/g'</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> file.txt</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">sed</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 's/error/ERROR/gi'</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> log.txt</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">sed</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 's|/usr/local|/opt|g'</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> paths.txt</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">sed</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 's#http://#https://#g'</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> urls.txt</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">echo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"2025-04-11\"</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> sed</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 's/\\([0-9]\\{4\\}\\)-\\([0-9]\\{2\\}\\)-\\([0-9]\\{2\\}\\)/\\3\\/\\2\\/\\1/'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">echo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"hello world\"</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> sed</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -E</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 's/(hello) (world)/\\2 \\1/'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">echo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"foobar\"</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> sed</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 's/\\(foo\\)\\(bar\\)/\\2_\\1/'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">sed</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -E</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 's/^([[:space:]]*)\"([^\"]+)\":/\\1\\2:/'</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> config.json</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">echo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"path/to/file.txt\"</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> sed</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 's/.*\\///'</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    # file.txt</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">echo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"path/to/file.txt\"</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> sed</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 's/\\.[^.]*$//'</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> # path/to/file</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">sed</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 's/password=.*/password=***REDACTED***/'</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> config.txt</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">sed</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -E</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 's/[0-9]{1,3}\\.[0-9]{1,3}\\.[0-9]{1,3}\\.[0-9]{1,3}/[IP_REMOVED]/g'</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> access.log</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"多重与条件替换\">多重与条件替换</h3><p>多重替换和条件替换：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"sed -e &#39;s/foo/bar/g&#39; -e &#39;s/baz/qux/g&#39; file.txt&#10;&#10;sed &#39;&#10;    s/Monday/周一/g&#10;    s/Tuesday/周二/g&#10;    s/Wednesday/周三/g&#10;    s/Thursday/周四/g&#10;    s/Friday/周五/g&#10;&#39; schedule.txt&#10;&#10;sed &#39;/^#/! s/localhost/production-host/g&#39; config.txt&#10;&#10;sed &#39;10,20 s/old/new/g&#39; file.txt&#10;&#10;sed &#39;0,/pattern/ s/pattern/replacement/&#39; file.txt\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">sed</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -e</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 's/foo/bar/g'</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -e</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 's/baz/qux/g'</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> file.txt</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">sed</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    s/Monday/周一/g</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    s/Tuesday/周二/g</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    s/Wednesday/周三/g</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    s/Thursday/周四/g</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    s/Friday/周五/g</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> schedule.txt</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">sed</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '/^#/! s/localhost/production-host/g'</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> config.txt</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">sed</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '10,20 s/old/new/g'</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> file.txt</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">sed</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '0,/pattern/ s/pattern/replacement/'</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> file.txt</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"地址与范围选择\">地址与范围选择</h2><p>sed 的地址机制决定了命令作用于哪些行。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>地址形式</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>5</code> / <code>$</code></td>\n<td>第 5 行 / 最后一行</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>3,7</code></td>\n<td>第 3 到 7 行</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>/regex/</code></td>\n<td>匹配正则的行</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>/A/,/B/</code></td>\n<td>从匹配 A 到匹配 B 的范围</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>0~2</code> / <code>1~2</code></td>\n<td>偶数行 / 奇数行</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>addr!</code></td>\n<td>取反（不匹配的行）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"地址用法示例\">地址用法示例</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"sed &#39;5d&#39; file.txt                      # 删除第 5 行&#10;sed &#39;$d&#39; file.txt                      # 删除最后一行&#10;sed &#39;3,7d&#39; file.txt                    # 删除第 3-7 行&#10;sed &#39;1,/^END/d&#39; file.txt              # 删除从第 1 行到匹配 END 的行&#10;&#10;sed -n &#39;10,20p&#39; file.txt               # 打印第 10-20 行&#10;&#10;sed &#39;/^$/d&#39; file.txt                   # 删除空行&#10;sed &#39;/^#/d&#39; config.txt                 # 删除注释行&#10;sed &#39;/^[[:space:]]*$/d&#39; file.txt       # 删除空白行&#10;&#10;sed -n &#39;/START/,/END/p&#39; file.txt       # 打印两个模式之间的行&#10;&#10;sed &#39;0~2d&#39; file.txt                    # 删除偶数行&#10;sed &#39;1~2d&#39; file.txt                    # 删除奇数行&#10;&#10;sed &#39;/pattern/!d&#39; file.txt             # 删除不匹配的行（类似 grep）&#10;&#10;sed &#39;1,5{&#10;    s/old/new/g&#10;    /^$/d&#10;}&#39; file.txt\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">sed</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '5d'</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> file.txt</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">                      # 删除第 5 行</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">sed</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '$d'</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> file.txt</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">                      # 删除最后一行</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">sed</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '3,7d'</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> file.txt</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">                    # 删除第 3-7 行</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">sed</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '1,/^END/d'</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> file.txt</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">              # 删除从第 1 行到匹配 END 的行</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">sed</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -n</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '10,20p'</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> file.txt</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">               # 打印第 10-20 行</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">sed</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '/^$/d'</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> file.txt</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">                   # 删除空行</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">sed</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '/^#/d'</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> config.txt</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">                 # 删除注释行</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">sed</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '/^[[:space:]]*$/d'</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> file.txt</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">       # 删除空白行</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">sed</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -n</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '/START/,/END/p'</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> file.txt</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">       # 打印两个模式之间的行</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">sed</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '0~2d'</span><span style=\"color:#032F6