pace:]]+//;s/[[:space:]]+$//'</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> file.txt</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">sed</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'G'</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> file.txt</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">            # 每行后加空行</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">sed</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '/^$/d;G'</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> file.txt</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">      # 先删空行再加空行（规范化间距）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">sed</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '='</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> file.txt</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> sed</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'N;s/\\n/\\t/'</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  # 给每行加行号</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">sed</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -E</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '/^[[:space:]]*$/{ N; /^\\n[[:space:]]*$/d }'</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> file.txt</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"高级模式空间操作\">高级模式空间操作</h2><p>sed 的保持空间（Hold Space）支持跨行处理，这是 sed 最强大但也最难掌握的功能：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"sed -n &#39;&#10;    /error/{&#10;        N            # 追加下一行到模式空间&#10;        p            # 打印（包含当前行和下一行）&#10;    }&#10;&#39; log.txt&#10;&#10;sed -n &#39;&#10;    /START/,/END/{&#10;        H            # 追加到保持空间&#10;    }&#10;    /END/{&#10;        g            # 保持空间 -&gt; 模式空间&#10;        s/\\n/ /g     # 将换行替换为空格&#10;        p&#10;    }&#10;&#39; multi-line.txt&#10;&#10;sed &#39;/^$/{&#10;    N&#10;    /^\\n$/d         # 将连续空行压缩为一个&#10;}&#39; file.txt&#10;&#10;sed -n &#39;1!G;h;$p&#39; file.txt    # 反转文件行序（等同 tac）&#10;&#10;sed &#39;/\\\\$/{&#10;    N&#10;    s/\\\\\\n//&#10;}&#39; continued.txt&#10;&#10;sed -E &#39;:loop; /\\{[^}]*$/ { N; b loop }; s/\\n\\s*/ /g&#39; code.json\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">sed</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -n</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    /error/{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        N            # 追加下一行到模式空间</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        p            # 打印（包含当前行和下一行）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> log.txt</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">sed</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -n</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    /START/,/END/{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        H            # 追加到保持空间</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    /END/{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        g            # 保持空间 -> 模式空间</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        s/\\n/ /g     # 将换行替换为空格</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        p</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> multi-line.txt</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">sed</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '/^$/{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    N</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    /^\\n$/d         # 将连续空行压缩为一个</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}'</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> file.txt</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">sed</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -n</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '1!G;h;$p'</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> file.txt</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    # 反转文件行序（等同 tac）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">sed</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '/\\\\$/{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    N</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    s/\\\\\\n//</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}'</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> continued.txt</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">sed</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -E</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ':loop; /\\{[^}]*$/ { N; b loop }; s/\\n\\s*/ /g'</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> code.json</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"配置文件批量修改\">配置文件批量修改</h3><p>配置文件批量修改的实战示例：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"update_config() {&#10;    local key=&quot;$1&quot; value=&quot;$2&quot; file=&quot;$3&quot;&#10;&#10;    if grep -q &quot;^${key}=&quot; &quot;$file&quot;; then&#10;        sed -i &#39;&#39; &quot;s|^${key}=.*|${key}=${value}|&quot; &quot;$file&quot;&#10;    else&#10;        echo &quot;${key}=${value}&quot; &gt;&gt; &quot;$file&quot;&#10;    fi&#10;}&#10;&#10;update_config &quot;DB_HOST&quot; &quot;production.db.example.com&quot; &quot;.env&quot;&#10;update_config &quot;LOG_LEVEL&quot; &quot;warn&quot; &quot;.env&quot;&#10;&#10;sed -i &#39;&#39; &#39;&#10;    /\\[database\\]/,/^\\[/ {&#10;        s/host = .*/host = new-db.example.com/&#10;        s/port = .*/port = 5433/&#10;    }&#10;&#39; config.ini\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">update_config</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    local</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> key</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">$1</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> value</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">$2</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> file</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">$3</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> grep</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -q</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"^${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">key</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}=\"</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">$file</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">then</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">        sed</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -i</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ''</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"s|^${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">key</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}=.*|${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">key</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}=${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">value</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}|\"</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">$file</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    else</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        echo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">key</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}=${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">value</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}\"</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> >></span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">$file</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    fi</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">update_config</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"DB_HOST\"</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"production.db.example.com\"</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \".env\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">update_config</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"LOG_LEVEL\"</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"warn\"</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \".env\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">sed</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -i</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ''</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    /\\[database\\]/,/^\\[/ {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        s/host = .*/host = new-db.example.com/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        s/port = .*/port = 5433/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> config.ini</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"常见陷阱\">常见陷阱</h2><p>sed 的跨平台差异和转义规则是踩坑重灾区，下表列出最常见的几类。</p>\n<p>| 错误写法                     | 问题                     | 正确写法               |\n| ---------------------------- | ------------------------ | ---------------------- | --- | --- | --- |\n| <code>sed -i &#39;s/a/b/&#39; f</code>（macOS） | BSD sed 需要备份后缀参数 | <code>sed -i &#39;&#39; &#39;s/a/b/&#39; f</code> |\n| <code>sed &#39;s/a+/b/&#39;</code>              | BRE 下 <code>+</code> 是字面量      | <code>sed -E &#39;s/a+/b/&#39;</code>     |\n| 路径含 <code>/</code> 用 <code>s/.../.../</code>   | 分隔符冲突需大量转义     | 改用 <code>s                | ... | ... | </code>   |\n| <code>sed &#39;N&#39;</code> 处理最后一行       | 末行无下一行导致丢行     | 配合 <code>$!N</code> 守护        |\n| 直接 <code>sed -i</code> 无备份         | 改错无法恢复             | <code>sed -i.bak</code> 留备份    |</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>sed 是面向行的流式编辑器，通过模式空间逐行处理文本</li>\n<li><code>s/old/new/flags</code> 替换命令是最常用的操作，支持正则表达式和反向引用</li>\n<li>地址机制支持行号、正则模式、范围选择，决定命令的作用范围</li>\n<li><code>-i</code> 选项直接修改原文件（macOS 需要 <code>-i &#39;&#39;</code>，Linux 使用 <code>-i</code> 或 <code>-i.bak</code>）</li>\n<li>保持空间（Hold Space）支持跨行处理，适用于多行模式匹配</li>\n<li><code>-E</code> 选项启用扩展正则表达式，避免繁琐的转义</li>\n<li>实际工程中，sed 常用于配置文件修改、日志清洗、批量代码重构</li>\n<li>复杂的多行处理建议考虑 awk 或 Python，sed 的保持空间虽强大但可读性较差</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"sed 流编辑器","id":"sed-流编辑器"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"替换命令详解","id":"替换命令详解"},{"level":3,"text":"多重与条件替换","id":"多重与条件替换"},{"level":2,"text":"地址与范围选择","id":"地址与范围选择"},{"level":3,"text":"地址用法示例","id":"地址用法示例"},{"level":2,"text":"实用编辑操作","id":"实用编辑操作"},{"level":3,"text":"插入、追加与提取","id":"插入-追加与提取"},{"level":2,"text":"高级模式空间操作","id":"高级模式空间操作"},{"level":3,"text":"配置文件批量修改","id":"配置文件批量修改"},{"level":2,"text":"常见陷阱","id":"常见陷阱"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"grep 与正则表达式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/shell-scripting/text-processing/grep-and-regex"},"next":{"title":"awk 编程","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/shell-scripting/text-processing/awk"}}